<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 10/11.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 10/11.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for June</p>
<p>10/11. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   June 10/11	  June 9/10</p>
<p> CZK	0.42627	     0.41936</p>
<p> DKK	2.10106	     2.10132</p>
<p> FIM	2.66425	     2.66093</p>
<p> HUF	0.0746		0.07478</p>
<p> JPY	0.12131	     0.12258</p>
<p> LTL	3.41953	     3.44504</p>
<p> LVL     24.07815	    24.15421</p>
<p> RUR	0.00237	     0.00239</p>
<p> SEK	1.75773	     1.77166</p>
<p> UAH	7.37367	     7.41612</p>
<p> USD     13.68		 13.7836</p>
<p> XEU     15.57126	    15.58512</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
